      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'm working on a memo for our senior partners about wealth redistribution strategies. Based on recent economic data and trends, which approach is actually more likely to ensure long-term societal stability in the US: implementing a Universal Basic Income (UBI) or sticking to more traditional, targeted welfare programs?",
